    "eyebrow": "Charlotte's Web · Founding team",
    "heading": "The story came first.",
    "lead": "Before there was a brand to market, there was a plant, a family, and more people asking for help than we could serve.",
    "facts": [
      {
        "k": "The situation",
        "v": "A small team, one plant, and a waiting list we had to cap at 15,000 families."
      },
      {
        "k": "My role",
        "v": "The entire marketing department until 2016, then I built and led the in-house creative and marketing team."
      },
      {
        "k": "What happened",
        "v": "$15M to $96M in annual revenue, a C$115M IPO in 2018, and #1 in food, drug and mass retail."
      }
